@startuml
title PayScale HTTPE - System Failover Under Peak Load Sequence (RTO < 30s, RPO = 0)

autonumber
actor "Client Load (12K TPS)" as Client
boundary "API Gateway / App Tier" as App
control "PgBouncer\nConnection Pooler" as PgBouncer
database "Primary DB Node\n(Shard 1 - Active)" as Primary
control "Patroni / Raft\nDCS Watchdog" as Patroni
database "Synchronous Standby\n(Shard 1 - Replica)" as Standby

== Normal Operation at 12,000 TPS ==
Client -> App: Submit Transactions
App -> PgBouncer: Query & Write Pipeline
PgBouncer -> Primary: Stream Queries via Transaction Pooling
Primary -> Standby: Synchronous WAL Streaming Replication (Zero Lag)

== Fault Event: Primary Hardware Crash (T = 0s) ==
Primary -> Primary: !! Node Hardware Crash / Network Partition !!
PgBouncer -> Primary: TCP Timeout / Connection Severed
PgBouncer -> PgBouncer: Buffer incoming client connections (Pause Mode)

== Failover Detection & Standby Promotion (T = 5s to 15s) ==
Patroni -> Primary: Heartbeat Check Failed (3 consecutive intervals)
Patroni -> Patroni: Master Lease in DCS Expired (TTL = 10s)
Patroni -> Standby: Issue Fencing Token & STONITH to isolate Old Primary
Patroni -> Standby: Verify Highest Committed WAL LSN Position
Patroni -> Standby: Execute pg_promote() -> PROMOTE TO NEW PRIMARY
Standby --> Patroni: Promotion Complete (Elapsed: 12 seconds)

== Traffic Redirection via PgBouncer (T = 16s to 18s) ==
Patroni -> PgBouncer: Update DNS / Configuration: New Primary IP
PgBouncer -> PgBouncer: Reload target host & unpause client queues
PgBouncer -> Standby: Establish new physical backend connections

== Application Recovery & Zero Data Loss Guarantee ==
App -> PgBouncer: Re-send buffered queries
PgBouncer -> Standby: Execute on NEW PRIMARY
Standby --> PgBouncer: Commit Success (Zero Committed Transactions Lost)
PgBouncer --> App: Query Results
App --> Client: HTTP 200 OK (RTO: 18.2 seconds total, RPO = 0)
@enduml
